Eqiov
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 96 ROTATE 1 U 1
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE DRAW COLUMN
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        DESTSRC Suit match
    DEST Size == 7
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
SRCSTACK Rank ascending
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
